)</td><td align="center">Mean # tagSNPs (SD)</td><td align="center">Median <italic>p</italic>-value<sup>a </sup>[1<sup>st</sup>, 3<sup>rd </sup>quartile]</td><td align="center">Estimated power<sup>b </sup>(SE)</td><td align="center">Mean # tagSNPs (SD)</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center">Cousin</td><td align="left">cases</td><td align="center">0.034 [0.0002, 0.0173]</td><td align="center">0.88 (0.033)</td><td align="center">16.5 (0.6)</td><td align="center">0.050 [0.0131, 0.1043]</td><td align="center">0.49 (0.051)</td><td align="center">20.2 (0.9)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">controls</td><td align="center">0.021 [0.0002, 0.0173]</td><td align="center">0.88 (0.033)</td><td align="center">16.6 (0.5)</td><td align="center">0.041 [0.0134, 0.1113]</td><td align="center">0.53 (0.050)</td><td align="center">20.7 (0.8)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">mixture</td><td align="center">0.033 [0.0002, 0.0176]</td><td align="center">0.87 (0.034)</td><td align="center">16.5 (0.6)</td><td align="center">0.040 [0.0125, 0.1124]</td><td align="center">0.55 (0.050)</td><td align="center">20.7 (0.7)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="center">Chapman-allelic</td><td align="left">cases</td><td align="center">0.002 [0.0002, 0.0176]</td><td align="center">0.88 (0.033)</td><td align="center">16.9 (0.3)</td><td align="center">0.050 [0.0129, 0.2307]</td><td align="center">0.50 (0.050)</td><td align="center">20.0 (1.0)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">controls</td><td align="center">0.002 [0.0002, 0.0176]</td><td align="center">0.88 (0.033)</td><td align="center">16.8 (0.4)</td><td align="center">0.047 [0.0136, 0.1792]</td><td align="center">0.50 (0.050)</td><td align="center">20.8 (0.8)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">mixture</td><td align="center">0.002 [0.0002, 0.0176]</td><td align="center">0.88 (0.033)</td><td align="center">16.9 (0.4)</td><td align="center">0.041 [0.0135, 0.1261]</td><td align="center">0.52 (0.050)</td>